  <section class="field-panel" data-panel="head">
    <h1 class="f-head">Loosing of minds through music, art &amp; human connection</h1>
  </section>

  <section class="field-panel" data-panel="body">
    <p class="f-body">BRKFST is a brand and event organizer that programs unconventional music
      performances &amp; pioneering musicians at unique locations. Our aim, however, is not to
      create parties, but to broaden our visitor&rsquo;s minds. Musically and artistically.
      We want to give you something to talk about with your friends. Or with a stranger.
      All our events are supported by a professional line-up. One which we don&rsquo;t reveal.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="field-panel" data-panel="exp">
    <div class="f-exp">
      <div class="f-exp-media">
        <video src="{{ 'about-media_experience.mp4' | file_url }}" autoplay muted loop playsinline preload="auto"></video>
      </div>
      <div class="f-exp-copy">
        <span class="f-label">Experience (1 of 1)</span>
        <p>Obi&rsquo;s House &mdash; DJ party scene. A moment in time; it stays with you,
           reshaping how you see and feel.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="field-panel" data-panel="founders">
